  "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix: scope App notifications to Studio users and group owners by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3098\n* feat(push): route iOS notifications by user with per-device controls by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3102\n* fix: gate Studio guidance by enabled MCP toolsets by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3103\n* [codex] Fix group chat recovery and avatars after clearing history by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3107\n* fix(codex): restore interaction MCP namespaces for plan and clarify by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3109\n* feat(push): add opt-in notification content previews by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3106\n* fix(coding-agent): recover when native compact exceeds context by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3112\n* fix: ensure DSH generated manifests have package identity by @lorenzozanee in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3116\n* [codex] add App-bound session sharing to existing chat APIs by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3117\n* [codex] verify share-scoped App identity and purchase access by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3121\n* Fix App share management and add scoped session settings permissions by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3122\n* fix: correct shared session metadata and hide revoked invitations by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3123\n* fix: restore Android task notification progress by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3127\n* fix: authorize shared context limits with model permissions by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3128\n* feat: add shared single-chat voice permission by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3129\n* fix(push): enable notification content previews by default by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3131\n* [coding-agents] apply Studio context windows and compaction thresholds by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3134\n* [codex] fix Android and iOS notifications showing the first Agent reply by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3135\n* [codex] Label auxiliary and ensemble models as Hermes settings by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3138\n* fix(settings): default new session push on and retain saved preferences by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3133\n* [codex] Filter model settings by page-selected Profile by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3142\n* feat(push): orchestrate iOS Live Activities by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3111\n* fix: preserve generated titles for attachment messages by @lorenzozanee in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3132\n* Hide social push entries and disable automatic social notifications by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3146\n* [codex] Prepare repository links for ekko-studio rename by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3147\n* fix: include session upload attachments in shared file access by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3144\n* fix(push): use device-level preferences for app push by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3151\n* fix(push): follow App locale in Live Activities by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3152\n* chore: release 0.7.24 with localized changelog by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3153\n* [codex] sync desktop package version to 0.7.24 by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3154\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/compare/v1.0.4...v0.7.24",
